[TITLE]
Import test network -- one file that touches every branch of EngCalcs.lpnInpParse.
Hand-written for dev/lpn-spike/validate_inp.js (ROADMAP Task 196). No tanks, so the
real EPANET engine and our own solver are comparing the SAME network and any
disagreement is an import bug rather than a cut feature.

